# Placeholder.
#
# The exported Power Platform solution for the Meridian Launch Copilot lands here,
# written by infra/copilot-studio/export-agent.ps1 (or the export job) as UNPACKED
# solution source:
#
#     solution/MeridianLaunchCopilot/Other/Solution.xml
#     solution/MeridianLaunchCopilot/bots/
#     solution/MeridianLaunchCopilot/botcomponents/
#     solution/MeridianLaunchCopilot/Connectors/
#     solution/MeridianLaunchCopilot/environmentvariabledefinitions/
#
# COMMITTED:     the unpacked directory tree above (diffable, reviewable in a PR).
# NOT COMMITTED: the .zip. It is a build artifact - produced during export, uploaded
#                to the workflow run, and repacked on import from this source. An
#                opaque blob in git defeats review, bloats history and merges badly.
#                Keep `infra/copilot-studio/solution/*.zip` in .gitignore.
#
# Format is unpacked XML (`--packagetype Unmanaged`), matching microsoft/copilot-alm-starter.
# The repo holds the UNMANAGED source because a managed solution cannot be exported;
# the import job packs a managed build from it.
#
# See ../README.md section 4.
#
# Delete this file once the first export lands.
